# 7b-3 (ticket OPUS-7B3-20260929-02; Q52: nothing but declared fields): a path to a field the for body does not declare.
# The root `for` is the body (after `end: for`), and q is no field of it -- refused where the path stands; nothing makes
# a field.
fn: mytest () int
    int: acc
    acc: 0
    for: int(i, 0) (i < 10) i++
        int: j i
        acc: j
    end: for
    int: k 0
    k: for\q
    return: k
end: mytest
int: r 0
r: mytest()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
